    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Benzenesulphonyl chloride</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Test for primary amines</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Hoffmann bromamide reaction</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Anti Saytzeff</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Carbylamine reaction</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Hinsberg reagent</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Hoffmann orientation</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>Known reaction of Isocyanates.</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
